{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":200,"text":"**Storage and persistence / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\n55 system members · 62 one-hop ghost neighbours · 80 canonical edges\nEvery incoming and outgoing edge of a member is shown, including parallel edges. Ghost cards retain status text and gap badges; grey borders mark neighbours unless a high/critical gap requires red. Arrows retain source direction; MISSING means an absent connection, not working data flow.\nCyan data · orange control · green persist · purple schedule · yellow UI · red event.\n[[NOS System Map.canvas|Return to overview]]","color":"5"},
